  "changelog": {
    "1.1.1": "-Races now occur on the planets that the tracks are on. They use a tiled bachground with a bunch of tricks to make it not boring, but all assets are unloaded when the race ends, so your vram should not be meaningfully affected.\n-Slightly nerfed the escudo",
    "1.1.0": "Cars can now no longer equip hullmods that affect their engines or speed, however, to compensate for this I have added in a new tuning shop available on all takeshido planets.\nFixed a bug where the game would sometimes crash when pressing several other keys while drifting.\n5 new cars.\n30 new npc drivers.\nraces are now all 2 laps, however, tracks are also smaller.\nsplit races into more tiers to account for the fact that npc cars can now have tuner shop upgrades and therefore fill out the other tiers better."
  },
